                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4">
                    <p>I am a passionate Computer Science student dedicated to building robust web applications and exploring modern software engineering concepts. My technical focus includes frontend web development, algorithm design, data analysis, and practical machine learning applications.</p>
